4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:14,520
I don't think they fell with us, but the corporal here has banged up pretty badly.

5
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,920
We need to get him to the temporary shelter above ground.

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,620
There should be medics there who can treat his wounds.

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,720
Hey! Idiot! You down there?

8
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,520
I can hear you! You okay?

9
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,180
Yeah, of course we are!

10
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,160
There's no way we die in a place like this, dumbass.

11
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:35,060
Hey, can you guys get out?

12
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,940
Yeah, no problem.

13
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,580
Then you guys go ahead and we'll catch up with you.

14
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,280
We've got to find a med team for the corporal.

15
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,160
We'll meet you at the defensive line.

16
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,260
Wait, shouldn't we...

17
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,520
Kay, see you at the line!

18
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:07,140
We'll be right back.

19
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,060
We'll be right back.

20
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:08,560
Let's go ahead and eat them.

21
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,560
We'll rust peer?

22
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:11,400
Let's do this in the puppy's sauce.

23
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:12,020
Let's go ahead and heal them.

24
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:13,200
Look out.

25
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:13,980
Let's do this in our show.

26
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:18,520
Let's do this in the Hyperion campaigns.

27
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:20,020
Let's move!

28
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,000
We've got to...

29
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:22,640
You take a pericle train,

30
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:25,040
have to do this in the potential!

31
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:39,640
Well, damn it. I didn't kill the commander, after all.

32
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:47,760
Impressive. That attack took out a whole squadron of our men.

33
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:51,300
It looks like the humans are sending in their strongest forces.

34
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,660
Strongest forces?

35
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:59,260
These soldiers are with the Vampire Extermination Unit's most elite squad, the Moon Demon Company.

36
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,620
All right, everyone.

37
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:07,420
Are you ready to end this war once and for all?

38
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:13,320
Then let's slaughter the livestock. Full-blown extermination.

39
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:18,640
Let me ask you something.

40
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:23,780
Do you really like the taste of human blood, or is this a twisted reenactment of the Last Supper?

41
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:32,040
Lend me your power, Demon Blade Mahirunoyo.

42
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,720
Don't hold back.

43
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:37,840
This is the fight that you've been training for.

44
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,540
Protect this line.

45
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:44,060
Kill every one of them.

46
00:02:44,060 --> 00:03:00,260
I don't want nobody to get killed.

47
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:07,820
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight.

48
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:14,180
So don't take all of the blame, we're always wet.

49
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:17,880
Always don't take all of the weight, you always do.

50
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:21,660
There will always be something you cannot control.

51
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:25,920
We will overcome, your salvation has begun.

52
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:31,380
Low sun, slow light, such a mess all over.

53
