135
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:44,900
Hey, you, wait!

136
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,400
They're going to die.

137
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,940
It's only a matter of time.

138
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:51,800
All right, fine.

139
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,320
